# W03 request — pushing a change to this file on the branch `w03/run`
# starts the W03 workflow on the Pi. On `main` it does nothing; it is the
# template.
#
# Same fields as the Actions form, one `key value` per line. Omitted keys
# take the form's defaults. The result lands in the measurement-log issue.
#
#   mode         list | pin | measure                    (required)
#   footage      measure: absolute path ON THE PI to *.scene files
#   model        pin/measure: manifest name    (default smolvlm-500m)
#   hf_repo      list/pin  (default ggml-org/SmolVLM-500M-Instruct-GGUF)
#   hf_revision  list/pin: branch, tag or commit          (default main)
#   files        pin: space-separated file names from the list output
#   license      pin: only if the model card states none
#   issue        where the result is posted               (default 9)
#
# Only a path is ever written here, never footage.
mode list
